  "goodToKnow": "Entlohnen means to pay or remunerate for work, slightly formal: fair, angemessen, schlecht entlohnt. Die Entlohnung is pay. Der Lohn is traditionally an hourly or weekly wage for manual work, das Gehalt a monthly salary; der Mindestlohn is the minimum wage. Belohnen means to reward. Synonyms: bezahlen, vergüten. Regular: entlohnte, entlohnt."
